WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.459
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.729 --> 01:43.080
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.130 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.690 --> 01:45.900
[Episode 15]

5
01:46.759 --> 01:48.840
From the Hound Pit in the west of the county

6
01:48.840 --> 01:50.440
to Yulu Pavilion in the east,

7
01:50.840 --> 01:53.430
Xinghua Alley is the only route.

8
01:53.430 --> 01:55.039
Gong Le knew exactly

9
01:55.350 --> 01:56.150
when Zhe Shan

10
01:56.400 --> 01:57.800
came and went every time.

11
01:58.479 --> 02:00.480
The methods used in the two throat-crushing cases

12
02:00.480 --> 02:02.230
were remarkably similar.

13
02:03.200 --> 02:04.640
The Divine Constable Tally is here.

14
02:04.640 --> 02:06.590
Listen carefully, suspects.

15
02:06.680 --> 02:08.080
If you tell the truth now,

16
02:08.090 --> 02:09.630
you can still keep some dignity.

17
02:09.630 --> 02:11.350
But if you lie,

18
02:11.680 --> 02:13.030
let's see if your heads are harder

19
02:13.030 --> 02:14.370
than the execution blade

20
02:14.370 --> 02:15.900
beside the Shangfang Drum.

21
02:16.120 --> 02:16.980
Sound the drum.

22
02:17.430 --> 02:18.340
Start the trial!

23
02:18.340 --> 02:20.550
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

24
02:28.120 --> 02:28.980
Second Master.

25
02:32.280 --> 02:34.240
Although the deceased, Ji Ada, drowned,

26
02:34.240 --> 02:35.560
the real cause of death

27
02:35.680 --> 02:37.940
was a beast's teeth crushing his throat.

28
02:38.680 --> 02:40.190
He was murdered.

29
02:40.590 --> 02:43.150
And the murderer is in this courtyard.

30
02:43.840 --> 02:44.800
Ji Ada

31
02:45.360 --> 02:47.690
was bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

32
02:49.010 --> 02:50.980
And he wasn't the only one.

33
02:51.470 --> 02:54.130
There was also Zhe Shan, the guard of Ji Mansion.

34
02:55.000 --> 02:55.800
Zhe Shan?

35
02:55.870 --> 02:56.550
Wasn't he

36
02:56.579 --> 02:58.070
bitten to death by the wolf demon

37
02:58.070 --> 02:59.600
controlled by Xia Jiuying?

38
03:00.470 --> 03:01.370
The real killer

39
03:01.400 --> 03:02.840
who put these two to death

40
03:03.590 --> 03:05.000
is not Xia Jiuying,

41
03:05.560 --> 03:07.000
but someone else.

42
03:12.870 --> 03:15.630
And those are the young master of the Gong family,

43
03:16.150 --> 03:16.960
Gong Le,

44
03:18.000 --> 03:18.800
and

45
03:20.240 --> 03:21.560
Old Madam Gong,

46
03:22.360 --> 03:23.240
Lady Wang.

47
03:29.680 --> 03:31.000
I don't understand.

48
03:31.150 --> 03:32.000
How did these two

49
03:32.000 --> 03:33.840
make the dog kill?

50
03:34.360 --> 03:35.310
As far as I know,

51
03:35.840 --> 03:36.780
Black Silk Leopard usually

52
03:36.780 --> 03:38.280
only takes orders from Gong Sihai.

53
03:38.280 --> 03:39.910
Lord Situ, do you believe

54
03:40.240 --> 03:42.310
that I can also control Black Silk Leopard?

55
03:42.310 --> 03:42.970
Well...

56
03:43.000 --> 03:44.160
Bring it over.

57
03:47.030 --> 03:47.910
Pour it in.

58
04:11.030 --> 04:11.800
Alright.

59
04:13.080 --> 04:14.560
Lord Situ, please

60
04:14.960 --> 04:16.560
step in front of the dog cage.

61
04:42.270 --> 04:43.070
What...

62
04:43.390 --> 04:45.040
What on earth is going on?

63
04:45.270 --> 04:47.060
Reda, the steward of the Gong Mansion,

64
04:47.060 --> 04:48.590
lives in this side room.

65
04:48.870 --> 04:50.240
He loves to drink.

66
04:50.270 --> 04:52.560
This wine was taken from his room.

67
04:52.560 --> 04:54.870
The deserted courtyard connected to this backyard

68
04:54.870 --> 04:55.880
was where Gong Sihai

69
04:55.880 --> 04:57.600
put Old Madam Gong under house arrest.

70
04:57.600 --> 04:59.240
And the bowl of rice porridge just now

71
04:59.240 --> 05:00.680
was Old Madam Gong's

72
05:00.680 --> 05:02.390
three meals a day.

73
05:02.680 --> 05:03.810
Lady Wang

74
05:04.560 --> 05:05.800
used wine

75
05:06.360 --> 05:07.480
and rice porridge,

76
05:07.830 --> 05:09.950
two easily accessible things,

77
05:10.390 --> 05:13.510
to make Black Silk Leopard kill.

78
05:15.600 --> 05:18.040
Mixing the wine and rice porridge?

79
05:18.750 --> 05:20.200
I... I understand.

80
05:20.220 --> 05:21.600
Dogs have very sharp noses.

81
05:21.600 --> 05:22.360
Black Silk Leopard

82
05:22.360 --> 05:24.240
hates this scent.

83
05:24.260 --> 05:26.660
Lady Wang used the dog's keen sense of smell

84
05:26.750 --> 05:28.040
to train Black Silk Leopard

85
05:28.040 --> 05:29.450
to hate

86
05:29.480 --> 05:30.560
this unique scent.

87
05:30.830 --> 05:32.230
With repeated training

88
05:32.260 --> 05:33.260
and stimulation,

89
05:33.560 --> 05:34.630
over time,

90
05:34.950 --> 05:36.159
once Black Silk Leopard

91
05:36.159 --> 05:38.240
smells this scent on someone,

92
05:39.240 --> 05:41.300
it will attack on its own.

93
05:43.600 --> 05:46.070
Old Madam Gong was confined to the mansion all year round.

94
05:46.070 --> 05:47.590
Naturally, she didn't know

95
05:47.590 --> 05:48.540
trivial details

96
05:48.560 --> 05:49.680
like boxers using rice water

97
05:49.680 --> 05:51.190
to soak their cloth strips.

98
05:51.190 --> 05:52.540
But Gong Le,

99
05:52.600 --> 05:54.830
who frequently visited the Hound Pit to see his friend,

100
05:54.830 --> 05:56.340
noticed it

101
05:56.430 --> 05:57.750
and kept that in mind.

102
06:06.800 --> 06:08.510
Every time Zhe Shan won a bout,

103
06:08.600 --> 06:10.830
he would go to Yulu Hall for some entertainment.

104
06:10.830 --> 06:12.830
His route took him through Xinghua Alley,

105
06:12.830 --> 06:14.800
right outside Gong Le's window.

106
06:19.040 --> 06:21.030
He smelled of rice water,

107
06:21.190 --> 06:23.190
coupled with the stench of alcohol.

108
06:24.040 --> 06:25.500
This undoubtedly made him

109
06:25.500 --> 06:28.450
a perfect target for Black Silk Leopard.

110
07:43.159 --> 07:44.430
Setting the dog to kill

111
07:44.800 --> 07:46.530
and hiding the body on the spot.

112
07:46.800 --> 07:49.240
Mingling is currently in its rainy season.

113
07:50.070 --> 07:51.950
With just one heavy rain,

114
07:52.390 --> 07:53.600
Zhe Shan's body

115
07:53.870 --> 07:55.830
would disappear without a trace

116
07:56.360 --> 07:57.120
and turn up

117
07:57.140 --> 07:58.900
in the Yan River 20 li away.

118
07:59.800 --> 08:00.830
But My Lord,

119
08:02.800 --> 08:03.600
my brother

120
08:03.630 --> 08:05.390
wasn't like those boxers

121
08:05.430 --> 08:07.000
who have rice water on their hands every day.

122
08:07.000 --> 08:07.790
How could he

123
08:07.820 --> 08:10.080
be bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

124
08:14.040 --> 08:15.560
Old Madam Gong

125
08:15.950 --> 08:17.360
should also have a pair of

126
08:18.000 --> 08:19.510
agate walnuts.

127
08:20.830 --> 08:22.960
Just as she used scent to train the dog,

128
08:23.040 --> 08:23.850
she used

129
08:23.880 --> 08:24.910
the unique sound

130
08:24.930 --> 08:27.160
of the agate walnuts knocking together.

131
08:27.160 --> 08:29.060
She covered Black Silk Leopard's eyes,

132
08:29.060 --> 08:32.429
knocked the walnuts together, then attacked it with her hairpin.

133
08:32.429 --> 08:33.669
After repeating this over and over,

134
08:33.669 --> 08:35.750
Black Silk Leopard

135
08:36.080 --> 08:38.200
would automatically attack

136
08:38.200 --> 08:40.120
whoever made that sound.

137
08:40.240 --> 08:41.010
That was

138
08:41.030 --> 08:43.360
Ji Ada when he was walking down the street.

139
08:46.870 --> 08:48.840
The best way for the killer to destroy the evidence

140
08:48.840 --> 08:50.120
was to throw it

141
08:50.440 --> 08:51.610
into the vast waters

142
08:51.720 --> 08:53.750
of Cui Lake.

143
08:57.200 --> 08:58.720
It would be so hard

144
08:58.960 --> 09:00.030
to recover 2 tiny walnuts

145
09:00.030 --> 09:01.240
from the water.

146
09:01.440 --> 09:02.600
Without physical evidence,

147
09:02.600 --> 09:03.840
it will be difficult to convict him.

148
09:03.840 --> 09:05.200
Bring up the stone slab!

149
09:12.960 --> 09:13.810
Isn't this

150
09:13.960 --> 09:16.360
the stone slab covering the flood channel?

151
09:17.360 --> 09:19.090
Everyone, look at these marks.

152
09:28.440 --> 09:29.510
After the murders,

153
09:29.840 --> 09:31.790
Gong Le used this crowbar

154
09:31.960 --> 09:33.960
to pry open the stone slab over the flood channel

155
09:33.960 --> 09:35.750
and hide Zhe Shan's and Ji Ada's bodies

156
09:35.750 --> 09:36.750
inside.

157
09:44.200 --> 09:45.240
This crowbar...

158
09:46.270 --> 09:47.360
Young Master Gong Le,

159
09:47.360 --> 09:50.090
you left it deliberately in the room, didn't you?

160
10:19.240 --> 10:20.410
I had a dog

161
10:20.430 --> 10:21.790
bite his neck off

162
10:24.960 --> 10:27.090
instead of subjecting him to torture,

163
10:27.550 --> 10:29.480
flaying him, and eating his flesh.

164
10:30.870 --> 10:33.080
That was the greatest mercy I could show him!

165
10:33.080 --> 10:33.910
Gong Le...

166
10:34.790 --> 10:36.000
Pay for my brother's life!

167
10:36.000 --> 10:36.390
Second Master!

168
10:36.390 --> 10:38.870
-Pay for my brother's life! -Second Master, calm down!

169
10:38.870 --> 10:39.630
Let go!

170
10:39.630 --> 10:40.440
Let go!

171
10:41.000 --> 10:43.480
Gong Le, are you pleading guilty?

172
10:43.630 --> 10:45.440
Those two were both killed by me.

173
10:48.000 --> 10:49.000
As for the method,

174
10:49.440 --> 10:51.030
it was exactly the same as what

175
10:51.030 --> 10:52.830
the Divine Constable just said.

176
10:52.960 --> 10:54.580
I had to ensure the training was effective

177
10:54.580 --> 10:55.440
and foolproof.

178
10:56.360 --> 10:57.150
Zhe Shan

179
10:58.870 --> 11:01.000
was just a guinea pig.

180
11:02.000 --> 11:03.550
My real targets

181
11:05.080 --> 11:06.870
were the ones who had the Gong family massacred back then—

182
11:06.870 --> 11:08.960
Qiu Sihai and Ji Ada!

183
11:10.080 --> 11:10.870
So,

184
11:11.390 --> 11:12.320
if the Divine Constable Bureau hadn't

185
11:12.320 --> 11:13.630
captured Qiu Sihai,

186
11:14.480 --> 11:17.010
he would probably have died by your hands too.

187
11:17.750 --> 11:18.910
I was just gambling.

188
11:20.910 --> 11:21.720
Gambling?

189
11:22.550 --> 11:24.630
If Qiu Sihai dies by my hands,

190
11:25.200 --> 11:26.550
there will be no witnesses left.

191
11:26.550 --> 11:28.200
Then the masterminds behind him,

192
11:28.200 --> 11:29.440
the real culprits,

193
11:30.670 --> 11:32.200
those high officials and nobles,

194
11:32.200 --> 11:34.390
cannot be uprooted!

195
11:35.270 --> 11:37.150
And the monstrous injustice suffered by the Gong family

196
11:37.150 --> 11:38.910
will never see the light of day!

197
11:45.870 --> 11:47.030
I bet that

198
11:49.770 --> 11:52.030
the lords of the Divine Constable Bureau

199
11:52.440 --> 11:54.200
are good officials who exonerate the innocent,

200
11:54.200 --> 11:57.060
suppress violence, punish evil, and promote good,

201
11:58.000 --> 11:59.600
and that you can bring true justice

202
11:59.600 --> 12:01.200
to us innocent people!

203
12:10.080 --> 12:11.670
Divine Constable, what you just said

204
12:11.670 --> 12:12.570
is all true!

205
12:12.590 --> 12:14.520
I have nothing to say in my defense!

206
12:16.120 --> 12:16.870
But my grandmother

207
12:16.870 --> 12:18.390
only followed the method I taught her

208
12:18.390 --> 12:19.630
to train Black Silk Leopard.

209
12:19.630 --> 12:20.690
She knew absolutely nothing

210
12:20.690 --> 12:21.670
about the murder plan.

211
12:21.670 --> 12:22.960
My Lords, please,

212
12:23.000 --> 12:25.200
considering my grandmother's old age,

213
12:27.480 --> 12:28.550
show mercy!

214
12:41.360 --> 12:42.440
Young Master Gong.

215
12:43.750 --> 12:46.750
To protect your grandmother,

216
12:47.790 --> 12:50.050
you chose to take all the blame yourself.

217
12:50.150 --> 12:52.120
To clear Xia Jiuying's name,

218
12:52.750 --> 12:54.810
you deliberately kept the evidence.

219
12:55.480 --> 12:57.340
You want to save your grandmother

220
12:57.440 --> 12:58.750
and Xia Jiuying.

221
12:59.870 --> 13:02.360
But the only person you never thought of saving

222
13:02.360 --> 13:03.600
is yourself.

223
13:04.720 --> 13:05.510
I, Gong Le,

224
13:07.670 --> 13:09.270
have no regrets in this life.

225
13:30.790 --> 13:31.850
Young Master Gong.

226
13:33.240 --> 13:34.240
Old Madam Gong.

227
13:35.240 --> 13:36.240
This case

228
13:36.790 --> 13:38.200
is not over yet.

229
13:40.790 --> 13:41.910
Get up first.

230
13:48.240 --> 13:49.030
Gong Le,

231
13:49.240 --> 13:50.040
let me ask you.

232
13:50.630 --> 13:52.040
You killed Ji Ada

233
13:52.200 --> 13:54.330
on the second day of this month, right?

234
13:54.390 --> 13:55.720
Yes, it was that day.

235
13:56.440 --> 13:58.200
That night, a fire broke out at the Hound Pit.

236
13:58.200 --> 13:59.870
Ji Ada was rushing back to his mansion

237
13:59.870 --> 14:00.960
when I intercepted and killed him.

238
14:00.960 --> 14:02.250
Fire!

239
14:02.440 --> 14:03.550
Put out the fire!

240
14:03.550 --> 14:04.080
Hurry!

241
14:04.100 --> 14:04.860
Oh no.

242
14:56.480 --> 14:57.790
That's strange.

243
14:58.600 --> 15:00.240
You killed him on the second day of the month,

244
15:00.240 --> 15:01.850
but on the third day,

245
15:02.000 --> 15:03.980
Mr. Ji invited us

246
15:04.000 --> 15:05.510
to drink at Tingchao Boat.

247
15:05.630 --> 15:06.820
That's impossible.

248
15:09.240 --> 15:10.210
Could it be that

249
15:10.630 --> 15:11.600
on that day,

250
15:12.480 --> 15:14.410
the one who fell from Tingchao Boat

251
15:15.000 --> 15:16.630
was Mr. Ji's ghost?

252
15:17.440 --> 15:18.360
On the third day,

253
15:18.360 --> 15:20.030
Ji Ada fell into the sea from Tingchao Boat.

254
15:20.030 --> 15:21.270
The four of us saw it with our own eyes.

255
15:21.270 --> 15:22.440
We couldn't be wrong.

256
15:22.440 --> 15:23.570
That's impossible.

257
15:23.960 --> 15:24.750
I clearly...

258
15:24.750 --> 15:25.480
Gong Le,

259
15:26.000 --> 15:28.000
are you sure the person you killed that night

260
15:28.000 --> 15:29.120
was Ji Ada?

261
15:43.750 --> 15:44.550
That night,

262
15:45.200 --> 15:46.530
the alley was very dark.

263
15:48.240 --> 15:49.030
I...

264
15:49.390 --> 15:50.030
I...

265
15:50.030 --> 15:51.390
You did kill someone.

266
15:52.000 --> 15:53.840
But the one who got killed was not Ji Ada.

267
15:53.840 --> 15:55.120
It was his double,

268
15:55.630 --> 15:57.200
and this is the corpse.

269
16:01.750 --> 16:02.600
His double?

270
16:08.360 --> 16:10.320
What a switch.

271
16:11.080 --> 16:12.000
Am I right,

272
16:13.270 --> 16:14.200
Mr. Ji?

273
16:18.360 --> 16:19.840
I really don't know

274
16:20.200 --> 16:21.870
what you are talking about, My Lord.

275
16:21.870 --> 16:22.960
Mr. Ji?

276
16:23.240 --> 16:23.870
Well...

277
16:23.870 --> 16:25.000
My Lord, you mean...

278
16:25.360 --> 16:26.440
he is Ji Ada?

279
16:27.630 --> 16:28.440
Ji Ada?

280
16:28.760 --> 16:30.750
Does that mean the one I killed was...

281
16:30.750 --> 16:31.550
Ji Er?

282
16:31.840 --> 16:33.720
There was never any Ji Er.

283
16:34.440 --> 16:35.670
From the very beginning,

284
16:35.670 --> 16:37.000
it was all Ji Ada

285
16:37.020 --> 16:38.080
using a double

286
16:38.100 --> 16:39.910
to fool the world!

287
16:46.030 --> 16:48.510
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

288
16:48.510 --> 16:49.570
Still pretending?

289
16:50.200 --> 16:52.300
You colluded with Gong Sihai

290
16:52.550 --> 16:54.390
to amass a lot of ill-gotten wealth.

291
16:54.390 --> 16:55.990
You were worried that one day

292
16:56.030 --> 16:57.200
your crimes would be exposed.

293
16:57.200 --> 16:58.000
So,

294
16:58.150 --> 16:59.750
you prepared a double.

295
17:00.080 --> 17:01.600
With just a little disguise,

296
17:01.600 --> 17:03.390
he could look exactly like you,

297
17:03.610 --> 17:04.359
just like

298
17:04.750 --> 17:06.349
your twin brother.

299
17:06.640 --> 17:08.680
You claimed that Ji Er was in poor health

300
17:08.680 --> 17:09.400
and usually

301
17:09.430 --> 17:10.829
never left the house.

302
17:10.960 --> 17:11.970
-So, hardly anyone remembers -Let's go back, Second Master.

303
17:11.970 --> 17:13.160
what he looks like.

304
17:13.160 --> 17:14.960
The elder brother does all kinds of evil things,

305
17:14.960 --> 17:16.000
while the younger

306
17:16.160 --> 17:17.650
-is a good man. -Go back and rest, Second Master.

307
17:17.650 --> 17:18.880
That's the impression

308
17:18.880 --> 17:19.920
the Ji brothers

309
17:19.960 --> 17:21.349
have given everyone.

310
17:21.589 --> 17:23.349
When the Divine Constable Bureau arrived at the Hound Pit,

311
17:23.349 --> 17:25.030
you knew you were in big trouble.

312
17:25.030 --> 17:25.829
So,

313
17:25.960 --> 17:27.829
late at night on the second day, you disguised yourself as Ji Er

314
17:27.829 --> 17:29.250
and set the place on fire.

315
17:29.680 --> 17:30.640
Go, go.

316
17:30.750 --> 17:31.550
Hurry up and go.

317
17:31.550 --> 17:33.220
You disguised yourself as Ji Er,

318
17:33.220 --> 17:35.830
so Ji Er naturally had to disguise himself as you,

319
17:35.830 --> 17:36.640
Mr. Ji.

320
17:37.310 --> 17:38.110
I guess

321
17:38.750 --> 17:39.550
that night,

322
17:39.830 --> 17:41.880
you were already prepared

323
17:42.000 --> 17:44.000
to kill your double.

324
17:49.260 --> 17:50.300
Where did he go?

325
17:50.510 --> 17:51.310
You, that way!

326
17:51.330 --> 17:52.450
You two, that way!

327
17:52.480 --> 17:52.960
Yes!

328
17:52.960 --> 17:53.270
Let's go!

329
17:53.270 --> 17:54.160
Stop chasing!

330
17:55.750 --> 17:56.800
S-Stop chasing.

331
17:57.000 --> 17:58.350
Let that child go.

332
17:58.350 --> 17:59.380
Second Master!

333
17:59.880 --> 18:00.960
You set the fire,

334
18:00.960 --> 18:02.070
and you let the person go.

335
18:02.070 --> 18:03.400
Think about how you're going to explain this

336
18:03.400 --> 18:05.130
to the Master when you get back!

337
18:05.790 --> 18:06.790
Stop chasing...

338
18:16.680 --> 18:17.720
Unfortunately,

339
18:17.880 --> 18:19.480
man proposes, God disposes.

340
18:20.200 --> 18:21.240
You didn't expect

341
18:22.750 --> 18:23.550
Gong Le

342
18:24.030 --> 18:26.170
to become the biggest flaw

343
18:26.400 --> 18:27.790
in your entire plan.

344
19:53.440 --> 19:54.470
Idiot.

345
20:15.440 --> 20:17.480
I couldn't figure it out at first either.

346
20:17.480 --> 20:19.440
If a crushed throat can kill him,

347
20:19.830 --> 20:21.400
why use a stone to smash him?

348
20:22.230 --> 20:22.720
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

349
20:22.720 --> 20:23.510
Gong Le.

350
20:24.750 --> 20:25.550
I'm afraid

351
20:26.160 --> 20:27.960
you never expected

352
20:28.480 --> 20:29.510
that the person you went

353
20:29.510 --> 20:30.830
to such lengths to kill

354
20:31.400 --> 20:34.060
was actually helping you carry out the killing.

355
20:41.440 --> 20:43.100
The man who was Ji Er at the time

356
20:43.350 --> 20:45.160
and is now Mr. Ji

357
20:45.400 --> 20:46.260
naturally knew about

358
20:46.260 --> 20:46.410
Gong Le's plan to move the body by water.

359
20:46.410 --> 20:48.750
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

360
20:48.750 --> 20:49.590
He knew

361
20:50.200 --> 20:52.160
the body would go from the river to the sea.

362
20:52.160 --> 20:52.960
So,

363
20:53.590 --> 20:55.160
he went with the flow.

364
20:55.880 --> 20:57.400
You put on the same clothes

365
20:57.400 --> 20:58.680
as the double from last night,

366
20:58.680 --> 21:00.350
threw a big celebration banquet,

367
21:00.350 --> 21:01.400
and put on a good show

368
21:01.400 --> 21:03.440
of falling into the sea to resist arrest.

369
21:03.440 --> 21:05.030
The purpose was

370
21:05.240 --> 21:06.190
to make the four of us

371
21:06.190 --> 21:08.510
witnesses to your death.

372
21:24.030 --> 21:24.890
Second Master.

373
21:25.830 --> 21:26.690
Second Master.

374
21:26.960 --> 21:29.090
The medicine is ready, Second Master.

375
21:33.440 --> 21:35.900
Second Master, it's time for your medicine.

376
21:41.830 --> 21:43.400
Why are you sweating so much?

377
21:43.400 --> 21:44.800
Did you have a nightmare?

378
21:46.440 --> 21:47.370
The medicine...

379
21:51.240 --> 21:52.100
Second Master!

380
21:52.240 --> 21:53.100
Second Master!

381
21:53.160 --> 21:54.000
Second Master!

382
21:54.000 --> 21:55.240
Bad news! Bad news!

383
21:56.240 --> 21:57.480
B-Bad news.

384
21:57.480 --> 21:58.680
Something terrible has happened!

385
21:58.680 --> 22:00.240
Why are you panicking?

386
22:00.240 --> 22:01.000
Master...

387
22:01.000 --> 22:01.790
Master...

388
22:02.160 --> 22:03.560
Master fell into the sea!

389
22:04.790 --> 22:06.920
Thus, Ji Ada,

390
22:06.920 --> 22:08.720
who had done nothing but evil,

391
22:08.830 --> 22:09.900
finally met his end.

392
22:09.900 --> 22:10.590
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

393
22:10.590 --> 22:12.720
Only Ji Er, the good brother,

394
22:13.270 --> 22:15.510
remained, innocent and blameless.

395
22:16.680 --> 22:17.980
Your baseless fantasies

396
22:17.980 --> 22:20.030
and speculations just now

397
22:20.030 --> 22:21.310
are truly

398
22:21.510 --> 22:23.110
absurd.

399
22:23.680 --> 22:26.270
Even if Gong Le killed the wrong person,

400
22:26.750 --> 22:28.270
that doesn't prove

401
22:29.440 --> 22:31.070
that the one lying here

402
22:32.550 --> 22:33.920
is not my brother.

403
22:34.270 --> 22:36.030
The body is severely decomposed,

404
22:36.030 --> 22:37.000
and the two possible times of death

405
22:37.000 --> 22:38.310
are only half a day apart.

406
22:38.310 --> 22:39.440
It is indeed impossible to determine

407
22:39.440 --> 22:40.970
that the deceased is Ji Ada.

408
22:42.070 --> 22:43.240
As for his double,

409
22:43.240 --> 22:44.970
that is even more nonsensical.

410
22:45.310 --> 22:46.870
We twin brothers of the Ji family

411
22:46.870 --> 22:49.240
are the cousins of Princess Ding.

412
22:49.310 --> 22:51.440
Everyone in Mingling knows this.

413
22:51.550 --> 22:53.960
My brother and I

414
22:55.070 --> 22:56.960
were born from the same womb.

415
22:57.270 --> 22:58.650
It is well-documented

416
22:59.030 --> 23:00.310
and verifiable.

417
23:01.750 --> 23:03.350
How can you say it's a fake?

418
23:03.510 --> 23:05.440
I did ask the bureau

419
23:05.480 --> 23:06.920
to investigate

420
23:06.920 --> 23:08.480
you two brothers.

421
23:08.750 --> 23:10.070
The Ji family originated

422
23:10.070 --> 23:11.550
in Dinghai, Yuezhou,

423
23:11.960 --> 23:14.110
and has made a living by fishing for generations.

424
23:14.110 --> 23:15.710
In the fifth year of Hongyun,

425
23:15.960 --> 23:17.480
a great plague struck Yuezhou,

426
23:17.480 --> 23:18.920
and your clan members were scattered.

427
23:18.920 --> 23:21.640
You two brothers became beggars

428
23:21.720 --> 23:23.310
and were never heard from again.

429
23:23.310 --> 23:25.240
The Mingling County Records states

430
23:25.240 --> 23:26.960
that in the 20th year of Hongyun,

431
23:26.960 --> 23:29.020
the Ji brothers settled in Mingling.

432
23:29.160 --> 23:31.350
Later, you reunited with Princess Ding

433
23:31.350 --> 23:32.610
and made your fortune.

434
23:33.960 --> 23:35.030
But I guess

435
23:35.240 --> 23:36.440
the real Ji Er

436
23:36.640 --> 23:37.900
must have died long ago

437
23:37.910 --> 23:39.350
during that wandering journey.

438
23:39.350 --> 23:41.550
The one who settled in Mingling with you

439
23:41.640 --> 23:43.640
was this double.

440
23:43.640 --> 23:44.480
Absurd!

441
23:48.550 --> 23:50.070
What you just said

442
23:50.720 --> 23:51.350
is nothing but

443
23:51.350 --> 23:53.160
your speculation.

444
23:53.160 --> 23:53.830
Fine.

445
23:54.880 --> 23:56.350
You want evidence?

446
23:56.640 --> 23:58.350
Then I will give you evidence.

447
23:58.880 --> 24:00.030
The real Ji Er

448
24:00.160 --> 24:01.350
is chronically ill,

449
24:01.720 --> 24:04.050
so he always stays indoors to recuperate.

450
24:04.160 --> 24:06.420
It's easy for a person to fake an illness.

451
24:07.350 --> 24:09.270
But if you want to change your complexion

452
24:09.270 --> 24:10.760
and truly present

453
24:10.780 --> 24:11.980
a sickly appearance,

454
24:12.270 --> 24:13.470
it's very difficult.

455
24:13.750 --> 24:15.880
If you don't believe me,

456
24:16.070 --> 24:17.640
you can find a doctor

457
24:17.960 --> 24:19.640
to check my pulse

458
24:20.350 --> 24:21.480
and see if my illness

459
24:21.880 --> 24:22.880
is real

460
24:23.160 --> 24:24.310
or fake.

461
24:28.310 --> 24:30.160
It only takes one trick to fake your illness.

462
24:30.160 --> 24:31.750
It comes and goes

463
24:31.750 --> 24:33.640
in the snap of a finger.

464
24:34.720 --> 24:36.030
Ji Er's pulmonary tuberculosis

465
24:36.030 --> 24:37.920
is caused by cold invading the Shaoyang meridian.

466
24:37.920 --> 24:39.460
There is an acupoint in the human body

467
24:39.460 --> 24:40.270
called Dazhui,

468
24:40.270 --> 24:41.550
which lies along the Governing Vessel

469
24:41.550 --> 24:43.950
and governs all the body's yang meridians.

470
24:44.350 --> 24:45.600
If a needle is used

471
24:45.750 --> 24:47.030
to seal this acupoint,

472
24:47.720 --> 24:50.120
the flow of qi and blood will be obstructed,

473
24:50.160 --> 24:51.510
producing

474
24:51.920 --> 24:53.920
the sickly appearance you see here.

475
25:36.720 --> 25:38.310
Even his lips have turned red.

476
25:38.310 --> 25:40.030
So you can fake an illness like this?

477
25:40.030 --> 25:40.830
Ji Ada!

478
25:41.030 --> 25:42.070
What else do you have to say?

479
25:42.070 --> 25:43.270
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

480
25:43.270 --> 25:45.240
Whether I am Ji Er

481
25:45.440 --> 25:46.920
or Ji Ada,

482
25:47.550 --> 25:48.830
it doesn't matter.

483
25:49.110 --> 25:50.270
Divine Constable Li!

484
25:50.270 --> 25:52.350
You insist that I faked my death to escape punishment.

485
25:52.350 --> 25:53.550
Then you must first

486
25:53.580 --> 25:55.060
convict me of a crime!

487
25:55.240 --> 25:56.350
Let me ask you!

488
25:57.070 --> 25:58.960
You said the Ji family had been reselling government salt.

489
25:58.960 --> 25:59.600
Besides a few

490
25:59.600 --> 26:01.110
unfounded confessions,

491
26:01.110 --> 26:02.350
do you have any solid evidence?

492
26:02.350 --> 26:02.390
You have to show it to everyone

493
26:02.390 --> 26:04.270
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

494
26:04.350 --> 26:07.640
so that I have no choice but to concede,

495
26:07.640 --> 26:08.550
right?

496
26:12.880 --> 26:14.920
After the silver needles were pulled out,

497
26:14.920 --> 26:16.920
your voice became much louder.

498
26:17.480 --> 26:18.270
Mr. Ji,

499
26:18.290 --> 26:19.350
that day,

500
26:19.550 --> 26:21.440
you set fire to your own Hound Pit

501
26:21.440 --> 26:22.970
and burned it to the ground.

502
26:23.350 --> 26:24.160
It shouldn't just be

503
26:24.160 --> 26:26.290
because you wanted to be a good person.

504
26:32.030 --> 26:32.830
Ji Ada.

505
26:32.920 --> 26:34.190
We have already found bricks made of salt

506
26:34.190 --> 26:35.830
in your Hound Pit!

507
26:37.750 --> 26:38.680
Let me tell you.

508
26:39.310 --> 26:41.160
It took me a lot of effort to find them.

509
26:41.160 --> 26:42.560
I almost choked to death!

510
26:45.680 --> 26:46.830
I didn't expect

511
26:47.440 --> 26:48.960
you to actually find it.

512
26:49.160 --> 26:49.960
Yan,

513
26:50.310 --> 26:51.880
you look careless, but you are actually

514
26:51.880 --> 26:53.160
meticulous and observant.

515
26:53.160 --> 26:54.030
Usually, because

516
26:54.030 --> 26:54.880
you guys are around,

517
26:54.880 --> 26:56.680
I am too lazy to use my brain.

518
26:56.920 --> 26:57.720
But when it comes to things

519
26:57.720 --> 26:59.110
that you can't solve,

520
26:59.110 --> 26:59.970
I, Yan,

521
26:59.990 --> 27:01.040
will step forward

522
27:01.060 --> 27:02.070
and do my part.

523
27:02.070 --> 27:02.830
As expected,

524
27:03.160 --> 27:05.240
you hid the account books

525
27:05.440 --> 27:07.680
for reselling government salt in the Hound Pit.

526
27:07.680 --> 27:08.830
You burned down the Hound Pit

527
27:08.830 --> 27:09.440
just to

528
27:09.470 --> 27:11.350
destroy the evidence.

529
27:11.960 --> 27:13.640
How you seized the government salt,

530
27:13.640 --> 27:15.650
how you sold it, and how you split the proceeds—

531
27:15.650 --> 27:16.550
they're

532
27:16.550 --> 27:17.550
all recorded here

533
27:17.680 --> 27:19.640
in detail.

534
27:19.720 --> 27:20.550
Ji Ada,

535
27:21.640 --> 27:23.270
what else do you have to say?

536
27:24.880 --> 27:25.680
My Lord.

537
27:37.070 --> 27:38.790
If it weren't for you little brat

538
27:38.790 --> 27:39.720
causing trouble

539
27:39.730 --> 27:40.920
and ruining my plan,

540
27:41.240 --> 27:42.510
the Divine Constable Bureau

541
27:42.510 --> 27:44.480
would never have traced it back to me!

542
27:44.480 --> 27:45.750
But so what?

543
27:46.070 --> 27:47.800
As long as His Highness Prince Ding

544
27:47.800 --> 27:49.750
is still a prince of the Great Shi,

545
27:50.030 --> 27:52.270
and my cousin is still Princess Ding,

546
27:52.300 --> 27:53.780
what can you rats

547
27:53.880 --> 27:55.480
do to me?

548
27:59.880 --> 28:01.880
Even if I die,

549
28:02.440 --> 28:03.370
the First Prince

550
28:03.750 --> 28:05.310
will never let you off.

551
28:10.030 --> 28:11.440
So, Mr. Ji, are you saying

552
28:12.750 --> 28:14.550
that reselling government salt

553
28:15.160 --> 28:17.320
was the First Prince's idea?

554
28:18.920 --> 28:19.750
Nonsense!

555
28:21.340 --> 28:21.510
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

556
28:21.510 --> 28:22.920
I never said that.

557
28:30.400 --> 28:31.160
Ji Ada.

558
28:31.160 --> 28:31.880
What is it?

559
28:39.160 --> 28:40.560
-Master. -Grandmother!

560
28:42.110 --> 28:42.720
Grandmother!

561
28:42.720 --> 28:44.640
Master! Master!

562
28:44.640 --> 28:47.110
-Grandmother! Grandmother! -Are you alright?

563
28:47.110 --> 28:48.510
Grandmother? Grandmother?

564
28:48.510 --> 28:49.480
Master!

565
28:58.720 --> 28:59.900
My Lord, please see clearly!

566
28:59.900 --> 29:01.540
I can testify.

567
29:01.560 --> 29:02.680
It was Master who found someone

568
29:02.680 --> 29:04.610
to pretend to be the Second Master.

569
29:05.510 --> 29:08.650
Every word the Divine Constable said is true.

570
29:09.030 --> 29:11.160
But I didn't dare to say it.

571
29:11.310 --> 29:13.760
If I had, I would die.

572
29:13.920 --> 29:14.750
Oh no.

573
29:14.750 --> 29:15.610
He's poisoned.

574
29:18.160 --> 29:19.820
The hairpin must be poisoned.

575
29:22.880 --> 29:23.900
Master...

576
29:32.550 --> 29:34.110
He's dead!

577
29:35.550 --> 29:38.030
Ji Ada is dead!

578
29:38.550 --> 29:39.790
Ji Ada...

579
29:40.310 --> 29:41.160
It's karma.

580
29:41.880 --> 29:44.920
It's karma!

581
29:45.440 --> 29:46.240
Grandmother.

582
29:46.640 --> 29:47.440
Grandmother?

583
29:53.720 --> 29:55.310
My good grandson...

584
29:57.050 --> 29:58.160
Good boy...

585
30:01.160 --> 30:03.070
In my whole life,

586
30:04.550 --> 30:06.440
the one I let down the most

587
30:08.440 --> 30:10.310
is you.

588
30:22.070 --> 30:23.000
Grandmother...

589
30:26.750 --> 30:27.920
Grandmother!

590
30:31.440 --> 30:34.340
Don't leave me.

591
30:39.550 --> 30:40.920
Grandmother.

592
30:42.110 --> 30:42.210
Grandmother!

593
30:42.210 --> 30:46.000
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

594
31:05.550 --> 31:06.310
Move!

595
31:12.000 --> 31:12.830
Stay here

596
31:12.850 --> 31:14.650
and wait for our lord's summons.

597
31:29.240 --> 31:30.030
Jiuying.

598
31:31.270 --> 31:33.070
I didn't expect we'd meet again.

599
31:44.480 --> 31:45.270
Xia Jiuying,

600
31:45.440 --> 31:46.750
you have been acquitted.

601
31:46.750 --> 31:47.680
Come with me.

602
31:50.160 --> 31:50.960
Jiuying,

603
31:51.310 --> 31:52.440
you can go out now.

604
31:52.750 --> 31:53.750
You can go now.

605
31:53.920 --> 31:54.750
Let's go.

606
31:54.750 --> 31:55.510
Go.

607
31:58.400 --> 31:59.110
Go now.

608
31:59.110 --> 31:59.750
Come on.

609
31:59.920 --> 32:00.720
Listen to him.

610
32:01.160 --> 32:01.810
Hurry up!

611
32:02.350 --> 32:03.270
Go!

612
32:04.920 --> 32:05.590
Go!

613
32:15.160 --> 32:15.830
Bye.

614
32:15.830 --> 32:16.550
Jiuying!

615
32:21.310 --> 32:22.640
Remember to think of me.

616
32:22.930 --> 32:24.010
Jiuying.

617
32:24.270 --> 32:25.920
If I weren't Gong Le,

618
32:26.150 --> 32:28.120
would I be like you,

619
32:28.550 --> 32:30.450
having a Wolfie as a friend?

620
32:30.880 --> 32:31.680
Hurry up!

621
32:32.200 --> 32:34.410
Wolfie is my friend.

622
32:34.790 --> 32:37.650
Gong Le is also my friend.

623
32:37.750 --> 32:39.960
Wolfie is your friend.

624
32:41.270 --> 32:43.830
Gong Le is also your friend.

625
33:19.240 --> 33:20.030
Jiuying.

626
33:20.680 --> 33:22.810
Are you still wearing the gold pendant

627
33:22.880 --> 33:24.160
Mr. Ji gave you?

628
33:24.790 --> 33:26.440
Since we are friends now,

629
33:27.880 --> 33:29.270
give it to me.
